speechtext:
1.	What -were the ordinary and special revenues of the Dominion of Canada during the years 1936, 1937, 1938, and 1939?
2.	What amount was contributed by each of the provinces during the above years?
3.	What is the population of each province?
4.	What amounts are required for the following: (a) ordinary administration expenditures;
(b)	interests on the debt of the dominion;
(c)	national railways deficits to be met?
5.	What amount was contributed by the federal treasury to each province of the dominion during the above years: (a) in regular grant; (b) unemployment relief contribution; (c) unemployment relief works;
(d)	loans to provinces; (e) advance payments made on wheat in each province?
6.	Were the loans referred to in section (d) of previous question refunded?
